---
export const prerender = false;

import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Garage freeze alert case study"
  description="How a Minnesota homeowner avoided pipe damage with Garage Temp freeze alerts and SMS notifications."
>
  <div class="page-shell page-stack">
    <section class="card animate-slide-in-left">
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-2">Customer story</p>
      <h1 class="card-title">“We got the text before the pipes froze”</h1>
      <p class="card-subtitle">
        A detached garage workshop in Minneapolis — unheated except for a small space heater on a timer.
        When a polar vortex dropped outdoor temps to −15°F, the heater failed overnight.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2 class="card-title">The setup</h2>
      <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 mb-0">
        <li>ESP32 + DHT22 pushing every 5 minutes to Garage Temp ingest</li>
        <li>Freeze threshold at 34°F with Pro SMS + Telegram routing</li>
        <li>Weekly digest for the household; share link for a neighbor who watches the house</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2 class="card-title">Timeline</h2>
      <ol class="text-sm space-y-3 mb-0 list-decimal pl-5">
        <li><strong>Day −30:</strong> ESP32 installed, freeze threshold set to 34°F, Pro trial started.</li>
        <li><strong>Day −7:</strong> SMS + Telegram tested with a manual “test alert” from the dashboard.</li>
        <li><strong>2:14 a.m.:</strong> Garage hits 33°F — SMS to both owners, Telegram to family channel.</li>
        <li><strong>2:22 a.m.:</strong> Smart plug restarted; dashboard confirms recovery above 38°F.</li>
        <li><strong>Next morning:</strong> CSV export reviewed; subscribed to Member for winter history.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[var(--color-accent)] pl-4 my-0">
        <p class="mb-2 italic">“We would have lost a full day of workshop time — and maybe a pipe — if the text hadn’t woken us up.”</p>
        <footer class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">— Homeowner, Minneapolis metro (name withheld)</footer>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2 class="card-title">What happened</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        At 2:14 a.m. the garage reading crossed 33°F. SMS fired to both owners; Telegram posted to a family channel.
        They restarted the heater remotely via a smart plug and confirmed recovery on the live dashboard before pipes in the shared wall had time to freeze.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-0 text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
        Typical Pro trial → Member or Pro subscription after winter. Your results depend on sensor placement and alert thresholds.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2 class="card-title">Try it on your garage</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Start free with live charts and email alerts. Upgrade when you want CSV history (Member)
        or SMS, push, and share links (Pro — 14-day trial).
      </p>
      <p class="mb-0">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="/pricing">See plans &amp; pricing</a>
        {" "}
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="/register">Create free account</a>
        {" "}
        <a class="text-link" href="/compare">Compare vs DIY</a>
        {" · "}
        <a class="text-link" href="/about/temperature-probe-case-study">Technical probe case study</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
